# Inngest client id | serve URL
#
# app_id = the `id` in `new Inngest({ id: "..." })` in your worker app.
# url    = public HTTPS serve endpoint (Inngest server polls this).
#
# Mastra apps: path is usually /inngest (NOT /api/inngest).
# Next.js / Express: often /api/inngest — match your framework.
#
# Examples:
#   my-api|https://api.example.com/api/inngest
#   my-mastra|https://workers.example.com/inngest
